{"id":10437,"date":"2026-04-13T22:25:36","date_gmt":"2026-04-13T22:25:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/?post_type=blogs&#038;p=10437"},"modified":"2026-04-28T23:04:21","modified_gmt":"2026-04-28T23:04:21","slug":"shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy","status":"publish","type":"blogs","link":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/blogs\/shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy\/","title":{"rendered":"Fix Shoulder Blade Pain Pregnancy &#8211; Expert Care in Dubai"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10437\" class=\"elementor elementor-10437\" data-elementor-post-type=\"blogs\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4bd0b37e e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4bd0b37e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66e9cc11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"66e9cc11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bringing a new life into the world is perhaps the most beautiful journey a person can undertake. As a father and a doctor here in Dubai, I often tell my patients that pregnancy is like preparing for a marathon. your body undergoes incredible transformations to nurture your little one. However, I also know that these changes can bring unexpected &#8220;hiccups,&#8221; and one of the most frustrating is <\/span>shoulder blade pain pregnancy related<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At the practice of <\/span><b>Dr. Usama Saleh<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we don\u2019t just treat symptoms; we support the person behind them. Understanding the <\/span>reasons for shoulder blade pain during pregnancy<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the first step toward finding relief, so you can focus on the joy of your growing family.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4223d5c0 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4223d5c0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47957836 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"47957836\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Does Pregnancy Affect Your Shoulder Blades?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49a0bc8c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"49a0bc8c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It might seem strange that as your belly grows, your upper back and shoulders start to protest. After all, the &#8220;action&#8221; is happening much lower down! However, the human body is a masterpiece of interconnected systems. When one part shifts, the rest must adapt.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c6bf2dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5c6bf2dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Role of Relaxin<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b551d6d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2b551d6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>From the very beginning, your body produces a hormone aptly named Relaxin. Its job is vital: it loosens the ligaments and connective tissues to allow your pelvis to expand for childbirth. The catch? Relaxin doesn&#8217;t just target the pelvis; it affects every joint in your body, including the delicate structures around your shoulder blades (scapula). When these ligaments soften, your muscles have to work twice as hard to keep you stable, leading to that familiar achiness.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ae61c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9ae61c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Shift in Your \"Center of Gravity\"<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-54ea1bf5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"54ea1bf5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As your baby grows in the second and third trimesters, your center of gravity shifts forward. To keep from falling over, your spine naturally curves, a change known as increased <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">lumbar lordosis<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. This &#8220;S-curve&#8221; forces your shoulders to round forward and your neck to strain, creating intense pressure right between the shoulder blades.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1afe4920 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1afe4920\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"435\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-1024x557.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-10018\" alt=\"causes of shoulder blade pain pregnancy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-1024x557.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-300x163.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-768x418.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/causes-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy.webp 1324w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1471659b e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1471659b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b0d4cfa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b0d4cfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Common Causes of Shoulder Blade Pain Pregnancy related conditions<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-507c6fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"507c6fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most cases of <\/span>shoulder blade pain pregnancy<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are a normal, albeit uncomfortable, part of the process. In my Dubai practice, <strong>I see several recurring themes:<\/strong><\/span><\/p><ul><li><b>Postural Strain and &#8220;The Dubai Desk Life&#8221;<br \/><\/b>Many of our expectant mothers work in high-pressure environments in the DIFC or Downtown Dubai, spending hours at a computer. Combining the natural weight gain of pregnancy with a seated desk position is a recipe for muscle fatigue. This often manifests as a burning sensation near the inner edge of the shoulder blade.<\/li><li><b>Sleeping Challenges<br \/><\/b>As you&#8217;ve likely discovered, finding a comfortable sleeping position becomes a nightly mission. Lying on your side without proper support can &#8220;tuck&#8221; your shoulder underneath your body, compressing the rotator cuff and irritating the nerves that lead to the shoulder blade.<\/li><li><b>Weakened Core and Pelvic Stability<br \/><\/b>Your core muscles are the foundation for your upper back. As they stretch to accommodate your baby, they lose some of their stabilizing power. This lack of &#8220;anchor&#8221; in the middle of your body forces your upper back muscles to overcompensate, leading to knots and spasms.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4480ccfc e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4480ccfc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5117ca2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5117ca2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">When to Pay Closer Attention: More Serious Causes<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38469b8a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"38469b8a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While most aches are &#8220;growing pains,&#8221; I always tell my patients to listen to their intuition. There are a few instances where shoulder pain is a &#8220;referred&#8221; signal from another part of the body that needs immediate medical attention.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29c90c4f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"29c90c4f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">First Trimester: Ectopic Pregnancy<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-298ea070 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"298ea070\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In the very early weeks, a sharp, sudden pain at the very &#8220;tip&#8221; of the shoulder (where the arm meets the shoulder) can be a sign of an ectopic pregnancy. This is a medical emergency where the embryo implants outside the uterus. The pain occurs because internal irritation affects the diaphragm, which shares nerve pathways with the shoulder.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b8b64e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8b8b64e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Second &amp; Third Trimester: Preeclampsia and Gallstones<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e5a2be7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3e5a2be7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Preeclampsia:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This condition involves high blood pressure and can cause pain under the right shoulder blade or in the upper right abdomen. If you notice facial swelling or blurred vision along with the pain, contact your doctor immediately.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Gallstones:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Pregnancy hormones can sometimes slow down the gallbladder. If you feel severe, stabbing pain under the right shoulder blade after a heavy or fatty meal, it could be a sign of biliary colic (gallstones).<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cbd0468 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3cbd0468\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"412\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-cuases.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-10021\" alt=\"shoulder pain cuases\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-cuases.webp 932w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-cuases-300x155.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-cuases-768x396.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bad6dde e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7bad6dde\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7df59714 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7df59714\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dr. Usama\u2019s Diagnostic Approach: Gentle and Thorough<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33817455 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"33817455\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you visit us at the <\/span><b>Dr. Usama Saleh<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> clinic, we treat your diagnostic journey with the utmost care for both you and your baby.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The Compassionate Consultation:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We start by talking. I want to hear about your daily routine, how you sleep, and exactly where the pain sits.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Postural Assessment:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I will observe how you stand and walk. Often, the way a mother carries her weight gives me the &#8220;clue&#8221; needed to fix the alignment.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Manual Testing:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I perform gentle range-of-motion tests. I might use a &#8220;scapular assistance&#8221; technique\u2014manually supporting your shoulder blade while you move\u2014to see if that relieves the discomfort.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Safe Imaging:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We generally avoid X-rays during pregnancy unless absolutely necessary. Instead, we rely on physical exams and, if needed, safe ultrasound imaging to check the soft tissues.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-13239d1b e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"13239d1b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c574017 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c574017\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Treatment Options for shoulder blade pain pregnancy related conditions<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ca8a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ca8a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The primary goal of treating <\/span>shoulder blade pain during pregnancy<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is to provide relief without unnecessary medication. We focus on conservative, holistic care.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-108f9c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"108f9c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Conservative Therapies<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ca549fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5ca549fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Prenatal Physical Therapy:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We use specialized exercises like &#8220;scapular squeezes&#8221; and &#8220;thread the needle&#8221; stretches to retrain your muscles to support your new posture.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Aqua Therapy:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The buoyancy of water is a miracle for pregnant women. It takes the weight off your joints and spine, allowing your shoulder muscles to finally relax.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Prenatal Massage:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Seeing a therapist who specializes in pregnancy can help release deep-seated muscle knots safely.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Temperature Therapy:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A warm (not hot) compress can soothe tight muscles, while a cool pack can reduce inflammation if you&#8217;ve had a sudden strain.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52d586b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"52d586b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Supportive Measures<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-28b067f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"28b067f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Pregnancy Pillows:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Using a full-body &#8220;C&#8221; or &#8220;U&#8221; shaped pillow can keep your neck, shoulders, and hips aligned while you sleep.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Ergonomic Support:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If you are still working, we recommend lumbar support for your chair and ensuring your computer screen is at eye level to prevent &#8220;slumping.&#8221;<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44e5e2fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"44e5e2fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"405\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/treatments-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-1024x519.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-10022\" alt=\"treatments of shoulder blade pain pregnancy\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/treatments-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-1024x519.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/treatments-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-300x152.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/treatments-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy-768x389.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/treatments-of-shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy.webp 1351w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59477681 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"59477681\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6db986e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6db986e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Tips For Dubai Lifestyle<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4297834f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4297834f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Living in the UAE offers wonderful resources, but also unique challenges.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The Heat and Hydration:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our Dubai summer can lead to dehydration faster than you think. Dehydrated muscles are more prone to cramping and spasms. I always tell my &#8220;family&#8221; of patients to carry a water bottle at all times.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>AC Sensitivity:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Many women find that sitting directly under a cold AC vent in a mall or office causes their neck and shoulder muscles to seize up. Always carry a light pashmina to protect your shoulders from the &#8220;chill.&#8221;<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Active Expat Families:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Many of our expat mothers-to-be are very active in prenatal yoga or Pilates. These are excellent, but ensure your instructor is certified in <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">prenatal<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> modifications to avoid overstretching the loosened ligaments around your shoulder blades.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6917cec7 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6917cec7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5829f7e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5829f7e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Prevention Tips: Staying Ahead of the Pain<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-300ba709 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"300ba709\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You may not be able to prevent every ache, but you can certainly reduce the frequency and intensity of <\/span>shoulder blade pain during pregnancy<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Movement Snacks:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Don&#8217;t sit for more than 30 minutes. Get up, do a few shoulder rolls, and walk for two minutes.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Watch Your Salt:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Reducing sodium can help manage the fluid retention that often makes joints feel stiff and painful.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Supportive Footwear:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Your feet are the foundation of your posture. Opt for supportive flats rather than high heels or completely flat flip-flops.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Gentle Strengthening:<\/b> Focus on your &#8220;upper back extensors&#8221;. the muscles that pull your shoulders back and down.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-491edc7f e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"491edc7f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inne