widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While Acetaminophen (Tylenol) is generally considered safe for occasional use, I always recommend talking to me or your OB-GYN first. We prefer to focus on physical therapy and postural changes to address the <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">root<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> of the pain rather than just masking it with medication.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1921\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1921\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Why is my shoulder pain worse at night? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1921\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-495f125b e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"495f125b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-679920bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"679920bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As you lie down, fluid retention can settle into your joints, and the weight of your belly can pull on your back muscles differently than when you are upright. Using a supportive pregnancy pillow is usually the best &#8220;fix&#8221; for nighttime discomfort.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1922\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1922\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Does acid reflux cause shoulder blade pain? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1922\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-513696ce e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"513696ce\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ab46677 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ab46677\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, believe it or not! Severe acid reflux or &#8220;heartburn&#8221; can cause referred pain that feels like it\u2019s located in the upper back or between the shoulder blades. This is quite common in the third trimester as the baby puts pressure on the stomach.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1923\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1923\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Can a chiropractor help with shoulder blade pain during pregnancy? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1923\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4cbca05 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4cbca05\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4aa7abb8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4aa7abb8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Osteopathic or chiropractic care can be very helpful, provided the practitioner is specifically trained in prenatal care. We often coordinate with these specialists to ensure your spine is aligned safely.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f033ab1 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1f033ab1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19bc5baf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"19bc5baf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Conclusion: A Path to a More Comfortable Pregnancy<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d48bdba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2d48bdba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pregnancy is a time of waiting and wonder, but it shouldn&#8217;t be a time of constant suffering. While <\/span>shoulder blade pain during pregnancy<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a frequent visitor for many mothers, it is not something you simply have to &#8220;tough out&#8221; alone.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">By understanding the changes in your body\u2014from the effects of Relaxin to the shift in your posture\u2014we can create a personalized plan that brings you back to comfort. Whether it&#8217;s through a &#8220;movement snack,&#8221; a session in the pool, or a simple change in how you sit at your desk, relief is possible.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ready to feel like yourself again? <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Book an appointment with Dr. Usama Saleh today<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and let\u2019s start your journey to a pain-free pregnancy.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c227b4d e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5c227b4d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3598b95c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3598b95c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">References<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8891d36 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8891d36\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/orthoinfo.aaos.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">American Academy of Orthopaedic Surgeons (AAOS) on Pregnancy and Aches<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/my.clevelandclinic.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cleveland Clinic &#8211; Shoulder Pain and Pregnancy<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.mayoclinic.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mayo Clinic &#8211; Preeclampsia Symptoms<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Bringing a new life into the world is perhaps the most beautiful journey a person can undertake. As a father and a doctor here in Dubai, I often tell my patients that pregnancy is like preparing for a marathon. your body undergoes incredible transformations to nurture your little one. However, I also know that these changes can bring unexpected &#8220;hiccups,&#8221; and one of the most frustrating is shoulder blade pain pregnancy related. At the practice of Dr. Usama Saleh, we don\u2019t just treat symptoms; we support the person behind them. Understanding the reasons for shoulder blade pain during pregnancy is the first step toward finding relief, so you can focus on the joy of your growing family. Why Does Pregnancy Affect Your Shoulder Blades? It might seem strange that as your belly grows, your upper back and shoulders start to protest. After all, the &#8220;action&#8221; is happening much lower down! However, the human body is a masterpiece of interconnected systems. When one part shifts, the rest must adapt. The Role of Relaxin From the very beginning, your body produces a hormone aptly named Relaxin. Its job is vital: it loosens the ligaments and connective tissues to allow your pelvis to expand for childbirth. The catch? Relaxin doesn&#8217;t just target the pelvis; it affects every joint in your body, including the delicate structures around your shoulder blades (scapula). When these ligaments soften, your muscles have to work twice as hard to keep you stable, leading to that familiar achiness. The Shift in Your &#8220;Center of Gravity&#8221; As your baby grows in the second and third trimesters, your center of gravity shifts forward. To keep from falling over, your spine naturally curves, a change known as increased lumbar lordosis. This &#8220;S-curve&#8221; forces your shoulders to round forward and your neck to strain, creating intense pressure right between the shoulder blades. Common Causes of Shoulder Blade Pain Pregnancy related conditions Most cases of shoulder blade pain pregnancy are a normal, albeit uncomfortable, part of the process. In my Dubai practice, I see several recurring themes: Postural Strain and &#8220;The Dubai Desk Life&#8221;Many of our expectant mothers work in high-pressure environments in the DIFC or Downtown Dubai, spending hours at a computer. Combining the natural weight gain of pregnancy with a seated desk position is a recipe for muscle fatigue. This often manifests as a burning sensation near the inner edge of the shoulder blade. Sleeping ChallengesAs you&#8217;ve likely discovered, finding a comfortable sleeping position becomes a nightly mission. Lying on your side without proper support can &#8220;tuck&#8221; your shoulder underneath your body, compressing the rotator cuff and irritating the nerves that lead to the shoulder blade. Weakened Core and Pelvic StabilityYour core muscles are the foundation for your upper back. As they stretch to accommodate your baby, they lose some of their stabilizing power. This lack of &#8220;anchor&#8221; in the middle of your body forces your upper back muscles to overcompensate, leading to knots and spasms. When to Pay Closer Attention: More Serious Causes While most aches are &#8220;growing pains,&#8221; I always tell my patients to listen to their intuition. There are a few instances where shoulder pain is a &#8220;referred&#8221; signal from another part of the body that needs immediate medical attention. First Trimester: Ectopic Pregnancy In the very early weeks, a sharp, sudden pain at the very &#8220;tip&#8221; of the shoulder (where the arm meets the shoulder) can be a sign of an ectopic pregnancy. This is a medical emergency where the embryo implants outside the uterus. The pain occurs because internal irritation affects the diaphragm, which shares nerve pathways with the shoulder. Second &amp; Third Trimester: Preeclampsia and Gallstones Preeclampsia: This condition involves high blood pressure and can cause pain under the right shoulder blade or in the upper right abdomen. If you notice facial swelling or blurred vision along with the pain, contact your doctor immediately. Gallstones: Pregnancy hormones can sometimes slow down the gallbladder. If you feel severe, stabbing pain under the right shoulder blade after a heavy or fatty meal, it could be a sign of biliary colic (gallstones). Dr. Usama\u2019s Diagnostic Approach: Gentle and Thorough When you visit us at the Dr. Usama Saleh clinic, we treat your diagnostic journey with the utmost care for both you and your baby. The Compassionate Consultation: We start by talking. I want to hear about your daily routine, how you sleep, and exactly where the pain sits. Postural Assessment: I will observe how you stand and walk. Often, the way a mother carries her weight gives me the &#8220;clue&#8221; needed to fix the alignment. Manual Testing: I perform gentle range-of-motion tests. I might use a &#8220;scapular assistance&#8221; technique\u2014manually supporting your shoulder blade while you move\u2014to see if that relieves the discomfort. Safe Imaging: We generally avoid X-rays during pregnancy unless absolutely necessary. Instead, we rely on physical exams and, if needed, safe ultrasound imaging to check the soft tissues. Treatment Options for shoulder blade pain pregnancy related conditions The primary goal of treating shoulder blade pain during pregnancy is to provide relief without unnecessary medication. We focus on conservative, holistic care. Conservative Therapies Prenatal Physical Therapy: We use specialized exercises like &#8220;scapular squeezes&#8221; and &#8220;thread the needle&#8221; stretches to retrain your muscles to support your new posture. Aqua Therapy: The buoyancy of water is a miracle for pregnant women. It takes the weight off your joints and spine, allowing your shoulder muscles to finally relax. Prenatal Massage: Seeing a therapist who specializes in pregnancy can help release deep-seated muscle knots safely. Temperature Therapy: A warm (not hot) compress can soothe tight muscles, while a cool pack can reduce inflammation if you&#8217;ve had a sudden strain. Supportive Measures Pregnancy Pillows: Using a full-body &#8220;C&#8221; or &#8220;U&#8221; shaped pillow can keep your neck, shoulders, and hips aligned while you sleep. Ergonomic Support: If you are still working, we recommend lumbar support for your chair and ensuring your computer screen is at eye level to prevent &#8220;slumping.&#8221; Tips For Dubai Lifestyle<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10020,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_theme","categories":[12],"tags":[78,79,77,75,76],"class_list":["post-10437","blogs","type-blogs","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-shoulder","tag-maternal-health-dubai","tag-postural-correction","tag-pregnancy-wellness","tag-prenatal-orthopedics","tag-shoulder-blade-pain"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/blogs\/10437","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/blogs"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/blogs"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=10437"}],"version-history":[{"count":12,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/blogs\/10437\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":10616,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/blogs\/10437\/revisions\/10616"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/10020"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=10437"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=10437"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=10437"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}